{"cls":"level","html":"\n<div class=\"pagehead\" id=\"phT1\"><h1 class=\"pg-t\"><span class=\"pg-n\">1</span>App overview</h1><p class=\"pg-s\">You say one sentence, and six layers relay it behind the scenes.</p><details class=\"pg-more\"><summary aria-label=\"Expand notes for this stop\" title=\"Notes for this stop\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">ⓘ</span> Notes</summary><div class=\"ph-one\">You say one sentence, and six layers relay it behind the scenes: the agent program orchestrates and acts, the LLM does the “thinking” and “writing”, training builds the skills offline, and compute makes it all run.</div><p class=\"ph-why\"><b>Why it’s designed this way: </b>Each layer does one job: the model can be swapped, tools added, training redone, without affecting each other.</p></details><div class=\"ph-top\"><span class=\"ph-lv\">Stop 1 of 11 </span><span>📍 App overview</span></div><div class=\"ph-map\" id=\"pmT1\"><span>On this page: </span><button class=\"\" data-sj=\"c_T1_0\" data-sp=\"T1\">Overview: six laye</button><button class=\"l3\" data-sj=\"walkCard\" data-sp=\"T1\">🎬 End to end: “Ch</button><button class=\"\" data-sj=\"c_T1_1\" data-sp=\"T1\">Each layer in one </button><button class=\"\" data-sj=\"c_T1_2\" data-sp=\"T1\">🧠 The logic under</button><button class=\"\" data-m2x=\"1\" data-sj=\"xComply\" data-sp=\"T1\">⚖️ Rules for using</button></div><div class=\"zoomnote\" id=\"znT1\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><div class=\"m-stage\"><div class=\"m-dg main\"><div class=\"m-vbar\"><span class=\"m-vh\">👆 Tap a box for details<br>🤏 Pinch or double-tap</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"vz\" data-vz=\"out\" aria-label=\"Zoom out\">−</button><span class=\"vp\" aria-live=\"polite\">100%</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"vz\" data-vz=\"in\" aria-label=\"Zoom in\">＋</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"vz\" data-vz=\"reset\" aria-label=\"Reset\" disabled=\"\">⟲</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"vz\" data-vz=\"full\" aria-label=\"View full screen\">⛶</button></div><div class=\"diagram m-vw\"><svg id=\"svgT1\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 1720\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-m=\"1\"><defs><marker id=\"ahT1\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#94a3b8\"></path></marker><marker id=\"arT1\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#d97706\"></path></marker></defs><rect x=\"4\" y=\"8\" width=\"372\" height=\"104\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"></rect><text class=\"lbl\" x=\"16\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">① You</text><g class=\"comp cat-io\" data-id=\"user\" data-train=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"The user’s sentence\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"14\" y=\"42\" width=\"352\" height=\"62\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" x=\"190\" y=\"70.5\">🙋 The user’s request</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"190\" y=\"90.5\">“Check tomorrow’s weather in Hangzhou and add an umbrella reminder”</text></g><rect x=\"4\" y=\"152\" width=\"372\" height=\"300\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#fdf4ff\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"></rect><text class=\"lbl\" x=\"16\" y=\"174\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">② Agent app layer (an ordinary program: orchestrates and acts)</text><g class=\"comp cat-agent\" data-id=\"app\" data-train=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Agent app layer\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"14\" y=\"192\" width=\"352\" height=\"66\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" x=\"190\" y=\"214\">Agent app layer</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"190\" y=\"234\">Turns the model into</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"190\" y=\"251\">a program that gets work done</text><text x=\"352\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"zm-h\">🔍</text></g><g class=\"comp cat-agent\" data-id=\"plan\" data-train=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Planning and task decomposition\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"10\" y=\"288\" width=\"112\" height=\"64\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:15px\" x=\"66\" y=\"317.5\">Planning</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"66\" y=\"337.5\">Break into small steps</text></g><g class=\"comp cat-agent\" data-id=\"tools\" data-train=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"④ Tool call\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"134\" y=\"288\" width=\"112\" height=\"64\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:15px\" x=\"190\" y=\"309\">Tool calling</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"190\" y=\"329\">Output JSON</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"190\" y=\"346\">a program runs it</text></g><g class=\"comp cat-agent\" data-id=\"memory\" data-train=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Memory / RAG\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"258\" y=\"288\" width=\"112\" height=\"64\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:15px\" x=\"314\" y=\"317.5\">Memory / RAG</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"314\" y=\"337.5\">Look things up, remember prefs</text></g><g class=\"comp cat-agent\" data-id=\"loop\" data-train=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Agent loop\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"72\" y=\"374\" width=\"112\" height=\"64\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:15px\" x=\"128\" y=\"403.5\">Agent loop</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"128\" y=\"423.5\">think → act → observe</text></g><g class=\"comp cat-safe\" data-id=\"guard\" data-train=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Guardrails\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"196\" y=\"374\" width=\"112\" height=\"64\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:15px\" x=\"252\" y=\"395\">Guardrails</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"252\" y=\"415\">Confirm writes</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"252\" y=\"432\">Block prompt injection</text></g><path class=\"arrow \" d=\"M190 124 V150\" marker-end=\"url(#ahT1)\"></path><rect x=\"4\" y=\"508\" width=\"372\" height=\"282\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#eef2ff\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"></rect><text class=\"lbl\" x=\"16\" y=\"530\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">③ LLM (does the “thinking” and “writing”)</text><g class=\"comp cat-llm\" data-id=\"llm\" data-train=\"yes\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"LLM (large language model)\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"14\" y=\"548\" width=\"352\" height=\"56\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" x=\"190\" y=\"573.5\">LLM</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"190\" y=\"593.5\">A next-word-guessing machine</text><text x=\"352\" y=\"596\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"zm-h\">🔍</text><g class=\"badge b-train\"><rect x=\"140\" y=\"537\" width=\"100\" height=\"20\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f97316\"></rect><text x=\"190\" y=\"551\">🔥 Updated in training</text></g><g class=\"badge b-use\"><rect x=\"156\" y=\"537\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\"></rect><text x=\"190\" y=\"551\">🔒 Read-only</text></g></g><g class=\"comp cat-tok\" data-id=\"tokenizer\" data-train=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Tokenizer\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"10\" y=\"634\" width=\"112\" height=\"56\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:15px\" x=\"66\" y=\"659.5\">Tokenizer</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"66\" y=\"679.5\">text → tokens</text></g><g class=\"comp cat-emb\" data-id=\"embed\" data-train=\"yes\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Embedding table\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"134\" y=\"634\" width=\"112\" height=\"56\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:15px\" x=\"190\" y=\"659.5\">Embedding table</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"190\" y=\"679.5\">token → vector</text><g class=\"badge b-train\"><rect x=\"140\" y=\"623\" width=\"100\" height=\"20\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f97316\"></rect><text x=\"190\" y=\"637\">🔥 Updated in training</text></g><g class=\"badge b-use\"><rect x=\"156\" y=\"623\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\"></rect><text x=\"190\" y=\"637\">🔒 Read-only</text></g></g><g class=\"comp cat-blk\" data-id=\"blocks\" data-train=\"yes\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"N Transformer blocks\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"258\" y=\"634\" width=\"112\" height=\"56\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:14px\" x=\"314\" y=\"659.5\">Transformer block</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"314\" y=\"679.5\">× many layers</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"686\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"zm-h\">🔍</text><g class=\"badge b-train\"><rect x=\"264\" y=\"623\" width=\"100\" height=\"20\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f97316\"></rect><text x=\"314\" y=\"637\">🔥 Updated in training</text></g><g class=\"badge b-use\"><rect x=\"280\" y=\"623\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\"></rect><text x=\"314\" y=\"637\">🔒 Read-only</text></g></g><g class=\"comp cat-out\" data-id=\"lmhead\" data-train=\"yes\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Output layer\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"72\" y=\"712\" width=\"112\" height=\"56\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:15px\" x=\"128\" y=\"737.5\">Output layer</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"128\" y=\"757.5\">Score words</text><text x=\"174\" y=\"764\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"zm-h\">🔍</text><g class=\"badge b-train\"><rect x=\"78\" y=\"701\" width=\"100\" height=\"20\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f97316\"></rect><text x=\"128\" y=\"715\">🔥 Updated in training</text></g><g class=\"badge b-use\"><rect x=\"94\" y=\"701\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\"></rect><text x=\"128\" y=\"715\">🔒 Read-only</text></g></g><g class=\"comp cat-io\" data-id=\"sample\" data-train=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Sampling\"><rect class=\"main\" x=\"196\" y=\"712\" width=\"112\" height=\"56\" rx=\"12\"></rect><text class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:15px\" x=\"252\" y=\"737.5\">Sampling</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"252\" y=\"757.5\">Pick one, append</text></g><path class=\"arrow \" d=\"M30 454 V506\" marker-end=\"url(#ahT1)\"></path><path class=\"arrow \" d=\"M50 506 V454\" marker-end=\"url(#ahT1)\"></pa